    Equip Spell. You can only use each of the following effects of "Fiendsmith''s
    Rextremende" once per turn. If this card is Fusion Summoned: You can discard
    1 card; send 1 LIGHT Fiend monster from your Deck or Extra Deck to the GY. If
    this card is sent to the GY: You can target 1 other "Fiendsmith" card in your
    GY or banishment; add it to your hand.'
